== NOTES
Every predicate takes a std::byte::Byte and is total: a byte of 128..255 is
simply not ASCII (false), never an error. Locale-, encoding- and
platform-independent: no libc classes, no Unicode categories, no case
folding. Classify a String by its UTF-8 bytes (std::str::encode_utf8) or a
