@topic stdlib.std::list::with_length
title: std::list::with_length -- intrinsic of namespace std::list
summary: std::list::with_length[List[T]{length: N}](xs): xs itself, now known to have exactly N elements, when it has; otherwise the declared error LengthMismatch, after `import std::list`.
index: stdlib
