summary: The number of slots of a MutableArray, written a.capacity(): fixed when the array is made.
index: stdlib
symbol: std::mutable_array::capacity
keywords: array length; size; count; number of slots; len
related: stdlib.module.std::mutable_array stdlib.std::mutable_array::at proof.list-bounds stdlib.std::list::length

